SUMMARY:You Can See Everything
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:25pm\, 1:25pm\, 4pm\, 5pm\, 7:35pm\, 8:35pm\nThirty-f
 our days before she’s sent to prison\, notorious Silicon Valley founder 
 Elizabeth Holmes invites a skeptical film crew to document her every move.
  What begins as an intimate portrait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-
 bending three-year journey into the abyss. From boundary-pushing directors
  Nathan Fielder and Lance Oppenheim comes YOU CAN SEE EVERYTHING.\nhttps:/
 /booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/2253fe54-2bfc-5f13-a870-7d2
 28700ae9a\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/2253fe54-2bfc-5f1
 3-a870-7d228700ae9a
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:f3363dc045d53d9b665a3b0fb752b32e81b37c20@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261107T091553Z
DTSTART:20261107T173000Z
DTEND:20261107T193000Z
SUMMARY:Gentle Monster
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:30pm\, 3:15pm\, 9:15pm\nFrom director and writer Mari
 e Kreutzer (Corsage\, Austria’s entry for the 95th Academy Awards)\, Gen
 tle Monster tells the story of concert pianist Lucy (Léa Seydoux)\, who h
 as just relocated her family to a country house hoping to ease her husband
  Philip’s (Laurence Rupp) severe burnout. Before they have a chance to s
 et up their new home\, an early morning police visit tears their life apar
 t. Trapped between the man she loves and the fear of what he may have done
 \, Lucy must face the situation alone as her world unravels. With a cast t
 hat includes Jella Haase alongside the legendary\, Academy Award nominee C
 atherine Deneuve\, Gentle Monster asks what we do when someone we love tur
 ns out to be someone we never really knew.\nhttps://booking.landmarktheatr
 es.com/launch/ticketing/dae3b1f9-4273-5462-b592-0d7f672fafa2\nFrom Pushpin
  Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/dae3b1f9-4273-546
 2-b592-0d7f672fafa2
END:VEVENT
